{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0463_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d3bf8b04c491fe9882f25f1f8e4bac3ed0facb49f6c6855fa3f5e64e784fcf3c", "ja": "（やよいの観光大使の仕事で追加オファーが\n届いたので、やよいと二人で再び街を訪れた）", "zh": "（因为弥生的观光大使工作又收到了追加委托，所以我和弥生两个人再次来到了这座城市。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0463_1001_005yay", "source_sha256": "3afc002be31203b96dc4f4996f6365b27b489fa204d98596dcc93fb5276123ed", "ja": "{$P$}、お昼休憩だそうです～。", "zh": "{$P$}，听说要午休了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0463_1002_p", "source_sha256": "0c120e9ce6a2596d8bc1b8428343f43572f766b545a7c86e066390eab001ff03", "ja": "やよい、お疲れさま。\nそれにしても、今日もずいぶんにぎわっているな。", "zh": "弥生，辛苦了。\n话说回来，今天也真是热闹啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0463_1003_005yay", "source_sha256": "10814a18ad748e147b374c8c636836c4bc25984f6385fd0b678693cd6e7c0de5", "ja": "はい！　わざわざ飛行機で来てくれたって人もいて、\nすっごく嬉しいなーって。", "zh": "是的！还有人特意坐飞机赶过来，我真的特别开心——。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0463_1004_p", "source_sha256": "8587c14ca09c6f7648e5897a9d655225dda4fbe354f683265d715fddcddd81a5", "ja": "担当の人も喜んでくれていたよ。やよいがプリント\nされているバスにも、行列ができてるし。", "zh": "负责的人也很开心呢。印着弥生图案的公交车前也排起了长队。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0463_1005_005yay", "source_sha256": "d62d96fc888134b7c7e4bdd4dc5ac5d5edd6cc127273e3de62d165ae41eb245f", "ja": "はう……私もさっきバスを見たんですけど、\nなんか、くすぐったいかもです……えへへ。", "zh": "哈……我刚才也看到那辆公交车了，总觉得有点不好意思呢……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0463_1006_madamustaff", "source_sha256": "5aa2ff824643931537f43279a30b86dc851a2c07dca0914ccec07412fff8cc60", "ja": "やよいちゃん、今日もおおきにな～。\nこれ弁当と、ちょっと早いけど今日のお土産や。", "zh": "小弥生，今天也多谢你啦～。\n这是便当，还有稍微给得早了点的土特产。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0463_1007_se", "source_sha256": "2b4786007efc925bb40a64e0295cf3358026f38bcf129476a97a55049031f410", "ja": "ドサッ、ドサササササッ！", "zh": "扑通、扑通扑通扑通！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0463_1008_005yay", "source_sha256": "70f1e5029d409d4b1d54bc538b8bab0d09e389fb39b7ccd5116abbc388aeb217", "ja": "はわわっ！　またこんなに、いいんですか～？", "zh": "哇哇！又给我这么多，真的可以吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0463_1009_madamustaff", "source_sha256": "4ac86552ccfbe7c616c2e2c6ba7162d2b2f16af40c14250fc8314bc654bc5dce", "ja": "そんだけ私らが感謝してるってこと。\nほんまやったら、もっとあげたいくらいや。", "zh": "这就说明我们有多感谢你了。\n要是可以的话，真想再多给你一些。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0463_1010_madamustaff", "source_sha256": "1ff41fe9941901c67ad2c5e4ca9bec18e0fcd1695a436709fc2e56070e520b46", "ja": "あと、おまけの飴ちゃんも持って行ってな～。", "zh": "另外，也把附赠的糖果带走吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0463_1011_005yay", "source_sha256": "9c43e3740a73d297c800c57b899a5f011005abd9122a26877ddebe29341219a8", "ja": "うっうー！　ありがとうございますー。\n劇場に帰ったら、みんなでおいしくいただきますねっ！", "zh": "乌呜—！太谢谢您啦—。\n等回了剧场，我会和大家一起好好享用的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0463_1012_madamustaff", "source_sha256": "ab52dac13ba4fd3d0c2284345bc7b6ed2f9a8799a86b2c6d68cf426cd870c0f6", "ja": "そうそう、そうしてくれると嬉しいわ。\nついでに宣伝もよろしくお願いな。", "zh": "对对，要是你能那样做，我会很高兴的。\n顺便也帮忙宣传一下，拜托啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0463_1013_005yay", "source_sha256": "a7067a576c2facbeb3943bcd37a2daf749731724e12e615fb9c9869208fb359d", "ja": "はいっ、任せてくださいね！", "zh": "好的！请交给我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0463_1014_p", "source_sha256": "96822dd921207d43430dd18cbf6d1614190faaed209ff258879de6bdb95825f1", "ja": "そういえば、前に来た時にたくさんお土産をもらって\n恐縮した話を聞いたけど、今日は良かったのか？", "zh": "说起来，我听说您上次来的时候收到了很多伴手礼，觉得很过意不去。今天这样真的好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0463_1015_005yay", "source_sha256": "2d54768732dd1ed5069294d28ee3e8548c5611b5cf734b9e7ea1c7a58dc4d3d7", "ja": "はいっ。こういうのは遠慮するんじゃなくて、\nちゃんと受け取って、喜んで……。", "zh": "是的。这种时候不该客气，而是要好好收下，开心地接受……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0463_1016_005yay", "source_sha256": "2c68ddb24944230e3e5a2de5a6bb198fdd83b32fea448a98136475825091a560", "ja": "その分、お仕事をしっかり頑張って、\nお返しするのが大人なのかなーって。", "zh": "所以，要好好努力工作，\n作为回报还回去，我觉得这才是大人吧——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0463_1017_p", "source_sha256": "572f8cdc25a992acb710a20fd56b464e2f05fa688eb0f3f1f35834381ccce6d8", "ja": "ああ、その通りだと思う。\nえらいぞ、やよい。それでこそ観光大使だ。", "zh": "啊，我也觉得就是这样。\n做得好，弥生。这才是观光大使嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0463_1018_005yay", "source_sha256": "7924620cc3feb032b00070b6c8f061b250bd44945216ce70fc193d4f6aa732c2", "ja": "えへへ、これからも街の魅力をいっぱい伝えて、\nもっともっと盛り上がるように、頑張りますね！", "zh": "嘿嘿，今后我也会努力宣传这座城市的魅力，让这里变得越来越热闹！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
